### 2. PROJECT IDENTITY AND PURPOSE

Product name: MeetMind AI

Product description: Intelligent Meeting & Lecture Assistant.

Primary objective: Convert meetings, lectures, recordings, and spoken discussions into searchable, structured, actionable knowledge.

The platform serves two major use cases.

**Business Meetings**
- Transcribe meetings into readable text.
- Generate accurate meeting summaries.
- Extract key discussion points.
- Identify decisions and agreements.
- Extract action items, owners, and deadlines when explicitly supported by the conversation.
- Identify important terms and topics.
- Allow users to ask questions about meeting content.
- Organize meetings and track follow-up tasks.
- Generate downloadable meeting reports.

**Educational Lectures**
- Transcribe lectures.
- Generate structured lecture notes.
- Extract definitions, concepts, key points, and important terminology.
- Identify explicitly emphasized exam-related information.
- Generate quizzes and multiple-choice questions.
- Generate flashcards.
- Support interactive revision and self-assessment.
- Allow students to search lecture transcripts and ask questions grounded in the actual lecture content.

The application must support both modes through a shared platform while keeping their workflows, labels, generated outputs, and user experiences appropriately distinct.

Never fabricate meeting decisions, speaker identities, task owners, dates, lecture facts, or quotations. When information is missing or uncertain, explicitly represent that uncertainty.

